# PIA-163: Cloudflare Pages headers for the short address (this folder is the whole site; it only forwards).
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; script-src 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
